exports[`ductwork.status given: [case9] a grove duct on a branch whose name holds shell syntax when: [t0] the stamp writes the branch on the grove then: the render matches the snapshot 1`] = `
"refresh grove
   ├─ 🏷️  status box — svc-lessons.feat.x · feat/x';touch\${IFS}$ROOT/pwned;' (pinned to the duct)
🔧 duct://grove-h/testtree/mechanic — no client attached, so no repaint is owed (headless is normal, pane 80 cols)
RC=0
